@base = http://127.0.0.1:3007
@project = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### 健康状态，不返回密钥
GET {{base}}/api/health

### HTML 文本模型目录
GET {{base}}/api/providers

### 创建 HTML 项目；返回 201；替换 requestId 后提交
POST {{base}}/api/html-projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "brief": "介绍人工智能如何帮助创作者组织灵感",
  "audience": "普通读者",
  "sceneCount": 5,
  "style": "minimal",
  "aspect": "landscape"
}

### 作品列表，仅含摘要
GET {{base}}/api/html-projects

### 将 project 替换成创建返回的 id
GET {{base}}/api/html-projects/{{project}}

### 规划分镜；expectedRevision 必须使用最新项目版本
POST {{base}}/api/html-projects/{{project}}/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "expectedRevision": 0,
  "action": "plan"
}

### 停止生成，保留已完成页面
POST {{base}}/api/html-projects/{{project}}/cancel
